WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.116 --> 00:00:02.210
A small anchor.

2
00:00:02.470 --> 00:00:03.591
Your way to read.

3
00:00:04.955 --> 00:00:07.707
Here is a paragraph, just as the page wrote it.

4
00:00:08.265 --> 00:00:10.134
Open BeBold, and turn it on.

5
00:00:12.439 --> 00:00:15.639
The start of each word gains a little weight, and nothing moves.

6
00:00:19.173 --> 00:00:21.840
Some people find that easier to hold their place.

7
00:00:22.026 --> 00:00:23.634
Others find it distracting.

8
00:00:23.851 --> 00:00:27.061
It is a reading preference, so keep it only if it helps you.

9
00:00:28.797 --> 00:00:31.599
The count describes this page, not how you read it.

10
00:00:32.839 --> 00:00:36.414
In settings, a live preview shows each choice as you make it.

11
00:00:37.964 --> 00:00:39.202
Bold adds weight.

12
00:00:40.082 --> 00:00:41.844
Underline marks it with a line.

13
00:00:42.972 --> 00:00:45.766
Background tint sets a faint wash behind it.

14
00:00:48.482 --> 00:00:50.487
Choose the treatment that works for you.

15
00:00:51.727 --> 00:00:54.752
Strength has five settings, from subtle to maximum.

16
00:01:00.736 --> 00:01:05.660
And you decide how much of each word gets the anchor: shorter, default, or longer.

17
00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:10.276
This reader keeps bold, at strength four.

18
00:01:11.578 --> 00:01:13.857
Real pages are more than paragraphs.

19
00:01:14.167 --> 00:01:17.810
Headings, lists, links, and columns receive the same anchor.

20
00:01:19.422 --> 00:01:23.278
Off or on, every element in this recording stays in the same place.

21
00:01:26.750 --> 00:01:30.084
That is because BeBold paints an overlay of emphasis.

22
00:01:30.425 --> 00:01:32.380
The original text stays intact.

23
00:01:34.426 --> 00:01:37.116
Select a sentence, and it selects like any other.

24
00:01:38.067 --> 00:01:41.352
Copy it into a plain text note, and the words arrive whole.

25
00:01:42.493 --> 00:01:45.352
Search the page, and the full word is still found.

26
00:01:46.654 --> 00:01:48.952
Some text should stay exactly as written.

27
00:01:50.378 --> 00:01:52.609
Ordinary sentences get the anchor.

28
00:01:52.888 --> 00:01:54.415
A code snippet does not.

29
00:01:54.694 --> 00:01:58.652
Neither does a dosage, a version number, or an account identifier.

30
00:01:59.024 --> 00:02:01.709
Anything you can type into stays plain as well.

31
00:02:02.577 --> 00:02:05.614
These rules are careful, but they are not a guarantee.

32
00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:11.141
And when a page shows a password field, BeBold leaves the whole page alone.

33
00:02:12.815 --> 00:02:15.202
Some pages are left alone on purpose.

34
00:02:18.612 --> 00:02:21.467
Back on the article, this switch controls one site.

35
00:02:23.695 --> 00:02:26.682
Turn it off, and the treatment leaves, with no reload.

36
00:02:27.116 --> 00:02:29.071
A second site keeps its own setting.

37
00:02:29.877 --> 00:02:33.553
The shortcut, Alt Shift B, switches the site you are on.

38
00:02:38.503 --> 00:02:40.248
The other switch means everywhere.

39
00:02:40.558 --> 00:02:43.161
Turn it off, and both sites go plain at once.

40
00:02:43.843 --> 00:02:46.699
Turn it back on, and the reader's preference returns.

41
00:02:48.249 --> 00:02:49.990
Greek is treated by default.

42
00:02:50.207 --> 00:02:53.727
Japanese is not, because half a word can be half a sentence.

43
00:02:54.843 --> 00:03:00.126
Some scripts are off by default, because prefix emphasis may not suit how they are written.

44
00:03:00.436 --> 00:03:03.613
You can turn each one on in settings, if it works for you.

45
00:03:05.473 --> 00:03:06.471
No account.

46
00:03:06.707 --> 00:03:07.805
No analytics.

47
00:03:08.041 --> 00:03:09.752
Your preferences stay with Chrome.

48
00:03:11.426 --> 00:03:17.876
BeBold makes no network requests of its own, and page text is read only in memory, in your browser.

49
00:03:18.248 --> 00:03:24.163
If you are signed in, Chrome can sync your preferences across your devices, the way it syncs bookmarks.

50
00:03:26.395 --> 00:03:29.758
Earlier versions rebuilt page text to apply emphasis.

51
00:03:30.099 --> 00:03:33.534
Version 2.0 applies it without rewriting the page.

52
00:03:34.154 --> 00:03:42.511
In the repository's August 2026 test run, thirty-seven sites showed no detected layout or accessibility changes.

53
00:03:43.193 --> 00:03:46.709
That is one measured run, not a promise about every page.

54
00:03:49.189 --> 00:03:50.412
The same paragraph.

55
00:03:50.722 --> 00:03:52.567
Off, and on, whenever you like.

56
00:03:54.152 --> 00:03:55.246
A small anchor.

57
00:03:55.506 --> 00:03:56.627
Your way to read.

58
00:03:57.185 --> 00:03:58.553
Keep it if it helps you.

59
00:03:59.049 --> 00:04:01.019
BeBold is available for Chrome.
